@host = http://localhost:5080

### List supported units
GET {{host}}/api/units

### Length: 10 meters to feet
GET {{host}}/api/convert?category=length&from=meter&to=foot&value=10

### Temperature: 100 C to F
GET {{host}}/api/convert?category=temperature&from=celsius&to=fahrenheit&value=100

### Mass: 5 kg to pounds (symbols and plurals work too)
GET {{host}}/api/convert?category=mass&from=kg&to=lbs&value=5

### Error: unknown unit (400)
GET {{host}}/api/convert?category=length&from=meter&to=parsec&value=1

### Error: missing parameter (400)
GET {{host}}/api/convert?category=length&from=meter
